<debugging> ([debugging.utility]): is_debugger_present and
breakpoint_if_debugging.  libstdc++ 16 defines both in libstdc++exp, for
which CBMC had no models: their "no body" checks failed
(cpp26_debugging_models).  Checked with GCC 16 (linked with -lstdc++exp).
